     2748                                             ).
     2749   END PROCEDURE.
     2750   PROCEDURE proc-br-gperval :
     2751   define variable vss-include-info26 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     2752   if b-sel:sensitive in frame Dialog-Frame then dO:
